{"id":"wb-6-680","name":"龟峰塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"龟峰塔","text":"龟峰塔，是位于中国广东省河源市源城区东南方向龟峰山上的一座古塔，始建于南宋绍兴二年（1132年）。被认为“河源八景”之首，另有“东江第一塔”之誉，也是是广东省内仅有绝对年份可考的南宋早期砖塔。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BE%9F%E5%B3%B0%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86856926,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856926","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b53c4efe7a577025799cb06c.jpg","title":"Guifeng_Tower01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guifeng_Tower01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/Guifeng_Tower01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Boris1601050607","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​设于龟峰公园","width":320,"height":427}}